l issue with `key_of`: it uses `registry.teams` sorted by match_count — but registry.teams is a property that sorts ALL teams every call — O(n log n) per call, called 2× per raw row (~47k calls) with ~600 teams each → 47k × 600 sort... that's slow. Let me optimize: precompute a dict base → best region entity once. Let me restructure key_of to use a precomputed map.\n\nAlso, `registry.teams` property computes `sorted(...)` each access — expensive in a loop. I'll build `stateless_map` once after finalize.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0590e917d001PWgbDKQ1Dz1rZm","sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","messageID":"msg_0590e498500116s3T6DU0Dmtrg"}}
