g? Hmm.\n\nAlso — another possibility: my alias merge created same keys for DIFFERENT matches. E.g. \"Nacional (URU)\" vs \"Nacional-URU\" same ✓. But wait — what about teams like \"Barcelona-EQU\"... no.\n\nLet me debug: find Libertadores raw rows with duplicate (season, home, away).","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_05919fb65001LQFFxnpKIIOWTE","sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","messageID":"msg_05919af2b001PRTDCBgsn2AIJt"}}
