{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788201387527,"sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_b8d00cf4b03b47cc97a2b72e","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom soccer_mcp import load_knowledge_base\nfrom collections import Counter\nkb = load_knowledge_base('data/kaggle')\nr = kb.registry\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition == 'Copa do Brasil']\nc = Counter((m.season, m.home, m.away) for m in ms)\ndups = {k: v for k, v in c.items() if v > 1}\nprint('Copa do Brasil pairs appearing >1 time per season:', len(dups))\nimport itertools\nshown = 0\nfor k, v in dups.items():\n    if shown >= 8: break\n    rows = [m for m in ms if (m.season, m.home, m.away) == k]\n    print(k, r.display_name(*k[1].split('|')), 'vs', r.display_name(*k[2].split('|')), [(m.date, m.round_label, m.score_str()) for m in rows])\n    shown += 1\nEOF"},"output":"Copa do Brasil pairs appearing >1 time per season: 1\n(2019, 'aparecidense|GO', 'ponte preta|SP') Aparecidense vs Ponte Preta [(datetime.date(2019, 2, 12), None, '1-0'), (datetime.date(2019, 4, 3), 'Round 1', '2-0')]\n","metadata":{"output":"Copa do Brasil pairs appearing >1 time per season: 1\n(2019, 'aparecidense|GO', 'ponte preta|SP') Aparecidense vs Ponte Preta [(datetime.date(2019, 2, 12), None, '1-0'), (datetime.date(2019, 4, 3), 'Round 1', '2-0')]\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom soccer_mcp import load_knowledge_base\nfrom collections import Counter\nkb = load_knowledge_base('data/kaggle')\nr = kb.registry\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition == 'Copa do Brasil']\nc = Counter((m.season, m.home, m.away) for m in ms)\ndups = {k: v for k, v in c.items() if v > 1}\nprint('Copa do Brasil pairs appearing >1 time per season:', len(dups))\nimport itertools\nshown = 0\nfor k, v in dups.items():\n    if shown >= 8: break\n    rows = [m for m in ms if (m.season, m.home, m.away) == k]\n    print(k, r.display_name(*k[1].split('|')), 'vs', r.display_name(*k[2].split('|')), [(m.date, m.round_label, m.score_str()) for m in rows])\n    shown += 1\nEOF","time":{"start":1788201387501,"end":1788201387522}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"All fixed:\n- Libertadores: 1,255 ✓ (all matches preserved, group + knockout distinct)\n- Champions: 19/19 tested OK\n- Copa do Brasil: 1,697 — hmm, 1,337 (Brazilian_Cup) + 1,123 (BRF Copa) = 2,460 raw. 1,697 unique. Cross-file overlap = 763 merged. Plausible? BRF Copa covers 2014-2023, Brazilian_Cup 2012-2021. Overlap 2014-2021 = 8 seasons. BRF Copa has ~1123/10 ≈ 112/season; Brazilian_Cup ~134/season. If BRF ⊂ Brazilian_Cup for overlapping seasons → overlap ≈ 1123 - (2022+2023 rows ~200) ≈ 920. Hmm 763 merged — some BRF cup rows didn't merge (dates >3 days apart or team name mismatches). \n\nWait, actually let me think about whether unmerged cross-file cup dups remain. 1,337 + 1,123 - 1,697 = 763 merged. If the true overlap is ~920, then ~157 duplicate rows remain as separate matches! That would double-count cup matches in stats/h2h.\n\nLet me quantify: find (competition, season, home, away) pairs that appear more than once with DIFFERENT stage keys (i.e., potential cross-file dups) in Copa do Brasil. But careful — legit same-pair-different-stage matches exist in cups (e.g. group vs knockout in Libertadores; in Copa do Brasil, same pair can meet in different rounds too? YES — e.g. 2019 final teams met earlier? Copa do Brasil is single-elimination — same pair CAN'T meet twice in one season... wait 2 legs same round (swapped). So within Copa do Brasil, same ordered pair twice in a season = data issue (or cross-file dup). Let me check.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_0591bc2f3001YVFALnaZSkuIFF","sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","messageID":"msg_0591b811a001I9ZA8GSvt3g6pZ"}}
