{"type":"tool_use","timestamp":1788201673058,"sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","part":{"type":"tool","tool":"bash","callID":"call_251ac0d92ec8493aab076cb4","state":{"status":"completed","input":{"command":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom soccer_mcp import load_knowledge_base, SoccerDataService\nkb = load_knowledge_base('data/kaggle')\nsvc = SoccerDataService(kb)\nprint(svc.standings(\"Brasileirão Série A\", 2020).split(\"\\nRelegated\")[0].splitlines()[-8:])\n# check Vasco 2020 match count\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A' and m.season==2020 and 'vasco|RJ' in (m.home, m.away)]\nprint('vasco 2020 matches:', len(ms), 'scored:', sum(1 for m in ms if m.has_score))\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A' and m.season==2020 and 'fortaleza|CE' in (m.home, m.away)]\nprint('fortaleza 2020 matches:', len(ms))\nEOF"},"output":"['13. Atlético-GO - 50 pts (12W, 14D, 12L), GF 40, GA 45, GD -5', '14. Bahia - 44 pts (12W, 8D, 18L), GF 48, GA 59, GD -11', '15. Sport - 42 pts (12W, 6D, 20L), GF 31, GA 50, GD -19', '16. Vasco da Gama - 41 pts (10W, 11D, 17L), GF 37, GA 56, GD -19', '17. Fortaleza - 41 pts (10W, 11D, 17L), GF 34, GA 44, GD -10', '18. Goiás - 37 pts (9W, 10D, 19L), GF 41, GA 63, GD -22', '19. Coritiba - 31 pts (7W, 10D, 21L), GF 31, GA 54, GD -23', '20. Botafogo - 27 pts (5W, 12D, 21L), GF 32, GA 62, GD -30']\nvasco 2020 matches: 38 scored: 38\nfortaleza 2020 matches: 38\n","metadata":{"output":"['13. Atlético-GO - 50 pts (12W, 14D, 12L), GF 40, GA 45, GD -5', '14. Bahia - 44 pts (12W, 8D, 18L), GF 48, GA 59, GD -11', '15. Sport - 42 pts (12W, 6D, 20L), GF 31, GA 50, GD -19', '16. Vasco da Gama - 41 pts (10W, 11D, 17L), GF 37, GA 56, GD -19', '17. Fortaleza - 41 pts (10W, 11D, 17L), GF 34, GA 44, GD -10', '18. Goiás - 37 pts (9W, 10D, 19L), GF 41, GA 63, GD -22', '19. Coritiba - 31 pts (7W, 10D, 21L), GF 31, GA 54, GD -23', '20. Botafogo - 27 pts (5W, 12D, 21L), GF 32, GA 62, GD -30']\nvasco 2020 matches: 38 scored: 38\nfortaleza 2020 matches: 38\n","exit":0,"truncated":false},"title":"venv/bin/python - <<'EOF'\nfrom soccer_mcp import load_knowledge_base, SoccerDataService\nkb = load_knowledge_base('data/kaggle')\nsvc = SoccerDataService(kb)\nprint(svc.standings(\"Brasileirão Série A\", 2020).split(\"\\nRelegated\")[0].splitlines()[-8:])\n# check Vasco 2020 match count\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A' and m.season==2020 and 'vasco|RJ' in (m.home, m.away)]\nprint('vasco 2020 matches:', len(ms), 'scored:', sum(1 for m in ms if m.has_score))\nms = [m for m in kb.matches if m.competition=='Brasileirão Série A' and m.season==2020 and 'fortaleza|CE' in (m.home, m.away)]\nprint('fortaleza 2020 matches:', len(ms))\nEOF","time":{"start":1788201673037,"end":1788201673057}},"metadata":{"openrouter":{"reasoning_details":[{"type":"reasoning.text","text":"Interesting — the computed 2020 relegated teams: Fortaleza, Goiás, Coritiba, Botafogo. Real world 2020 relegated: Coritiba, Botafogo, Vasco da Gama, Goiás. My table has Fortaleza in the bottom 4 instead of Vasco. Hmm — is there a data issue with Vasco 2020 or Fortaleza 2020?\n\nWait — 2020 was Flamengo champion with 71 pts (real: Flamengo 71). The champion is right. Let me check the 2020 bottom of the table and Vasco's record. Vasco 2020 real: 41 pts (relegated, 17th... actually Vasco was 17th? No — 2020 relegated: Coritiba (31), Botafogo (27), Vasco (41), Goiás (36)? Hmm no. Let me recall: 2020 Série A final standings: ...17. Vasco 41? No wait — Vasco was relegated in 2020 with 41 points? That can't be — 41 points is usually safe. Let me think: 2020 relegated teams were Coritiba, Botafogo, Vasco, Goiás. Vasco had 41 points?? No — Vasco had 41 points in 2022?? Hmm.\n\nActually 2020: Vasco finished 17th with 41 pts? The cutoff was tight — 41 points were NOT enough that year? No wait — in 2020, 15th place (Fortaleza) had 44, 16th (Cuiabá)? Cuiabá wasn't in 2020... 2020 teams included Cuiabá? No — Cuiabá was promoted for 2021.\n\n2020 Serie A final: 15th Sport? Let me just check the data: maybe Fortaleza is at 44 and Vasco at 41 in my table too — then my bottom-4 = Goiás, Coritiba, Botafogo + Fortaleza?? That would mean Fortaleza below Vasco. Let me print the actual computed bottom of 2020 table.","format":"unknown","index":0}]}},"id":"prt_059201e610019A3A0PlzI8TdkR","sessionID":"ses_fa7021914ffexcBCZnAM1HV8iX","messageID":"msg_0591fe06c00181uhSf5El7181Y"}}
